This repository contains only the composite GitHub Action (action.yml) that
installs the published `codna` package from PyPI and runs it, together with
the repository's documentation and automation. The `codna` package itself --
the Codna CLI, its packaged local runtime and the agent-core sidecar it ships
-- is separately distributed and is not included here; it is subject to its
own license terms, not to this repository's LICENSE. The Algenta Engine is
likewise separately distributed and proprietary.
